## Phase Gate Definitions

### Gate 0 — Planning Complete

**Entry**: System requirements allocated, DAL/AL determined
**Activities**: PSAC/PSAA, SDP, SVP, SCMP, SQAP drafted and reviewed
**Exit criteria**:
- [ ] All five planning documents reviewed and approved
- [ ] Three standards documents (SRS, SDS, SCS) established
- [ ] Tool register populated with qualification assessments
- [ ] SOI #1 (planning review) completed with authority
- [ ] This AGENTS.md reviewed and approved by project lead
- **Approval**: {{APPROVER_ROLE}}

### Gate 1 — Requirements Complete

**Entry**: Gate 0 passed, system requirements baselined
**Activities**: HLR development, LLR development (DAL C+), derived requirements identification
**Exit criteria**:
- [ ] All system requirements decomposed to ≥1 HLR
- [ ] All HLRs reviewed for attributes (unique, testable, unambiguous, complete, consistent, traceable)
- [ ] LLRs complete for all HLRs (DAL C+)
- [ ] All derived requirements identified, flagged, and safety-assessed
- [ ] Traceability matrix forward-complete: system reqs → HLRs → LLRs
- [ ] Requirements baseline established (`BL-{{MODULE}}-REQ-001`)
- **Approval**: {{APPROVER_ROLE}}

### Gate 2 — Design Complete

**Entry**: Gate 1 passed, requirements baselined
**Activities**: Architecture design, detailed design, interface definition
**Exit criteria**:
- [ ] Architecture describes all components, interfaces, data flow, control flow
- [ ] Every design element traces to ≥1 requirement
- [ ] Partitioning strategy documented (if mixed-criticality)
- [ ] Data coupling and control coupling identified
- [ ] Design reviewed against requirements (bidirectional)
- [ ] Design baseline established (`BL-{{MODULE}}-DES-001`)
- **Approval**: {{APPROVER_ROLE}}

### Gate 3 — Code Complete

**Entry**: Gate 2 passed, design baselined
**Activities**: Implementation, static analysis, independent code review
**Exit criteria**:
- [ ] All source code has traceability headers (@req, @design, @status)
- [ ] All derived implementation decisions flagged with @derived
- [ ] Static analysis clean (zero unresolved safety-relevant findings)
- [ ] Independent human code review completed for all modules
- [ ] Coding standards compliance verified
- [ ] Code baseline established (`BL-{{MODULE}}-CODE-001`)
- **Approval**: {{APPROVER_ROLE}}

### Gate 4 — Integration Complete

**Entry**: Gate 3 passed, code baselined
**Activities**: Compilation, linking, loading to target, integration testing
**Exit criteria**:
- [ ] Executable Object Code built from baselined source
- [ ] Build is reproducible (same source → same binary)
- [ ] Integration tests pass on target hardware
- [ ] No unresolved linker warnings or errors
- **Approval**: {{APPROVER_ROLE}}

### Gate 5 — Verification Complete

**Entry**: Gates 1–4 passed (verification runs concurrently but closes here)
**Activities**: Requirements-based testing, structural coverage analysis, verification completeness review
**Exit criteria**:
- [ ] Requirements-based test cases exist for 100% of requirements
- [ ] All test cases executed with results recorded
- [ ] Normal range tests: 100% pass
- [ ] Robustness tests: 100% pass (DAL C+)
- [ ] HW/SW integration tests: 100% pass
- [ ] Structural coverage meets DAL target: {{statement / decision / MC/DC}}
- [ ] All coverage gaps resolved per approved methods
- [ ] All Problem Reports dispositioned
- [ ] Traceability matrix complete in both directions
- [ ] SOI #3 (verification review) completed with authority
- [ ] Test baseline established (`BL-{{MODULE}}-TST-001`)
- **Approval**: {{APPROVER_ROLE}}

### Gate 6 — CM Audit Complete

**Entry**: Gate 5 passed
**Activities**: Configuration audit, SQA records review
**Exit criteria**:
- [ ] All lifecycle data items at correct CC1/CC2 status
- [ ] All baselines verified (requirements, design, code, test)
- [ ] All Problem Reports closed or deferred with safety justification
- [ ] All Change Requests closed
- [ ] CM records complete and auditable
- [ ] SQA records confirm process compliance throughout project
- **Approval**: {{APPROVER_ROLE}}

### Gate 7 — Approval/Certification Ready

**Entry**: Gate 6 passed
**Activities**: SAS completion, final compliance review, authority submission
**Exit criteria**:
- [ ] SAS documents planned vs. accomplished for every Annex A objective
- [ ] All deviations documented and justified
- [ ] Open items list reviewed with authority
- [ ] SOI #4 (final review) completed with authority
- [ ] Release baseline established (`BL-{{MODULE}}-REL-001`)
- **Approval**: {{APPROVER_ROLE}} + {{AUTHORITY_REPRESENTATIVE}}

